    {
      "type": "div",
      "alignment": "center",
      "markdown": "<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nAt the Nintendo booth in front\n\nof the Treehouse Live set\n\n{% lineblog_image id=\"line-4186463-002\" alt=\"\" %}\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n8:00 AM\n\n\nThey put makeup on me (lol)\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n8:30 AM\n\nSetting up earphones\n\nand microphones\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n{% lineblog_image id=\"line-4186463-003\" alt=\"\" %}\n\n\nNervous before the show so\nnot much of a smile (lol)\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nAnd finally\n\n9:00 AM\n\nThe show begins!\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nStreamed on NicoNico Live,\n\nTwitch and other sites!\n\n\n{% lineblog_image id=\"line-4186463-004\" alt=\"\" %}\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n{% lineblog_image id=\"line-4186463-005\" alt=\"\" %}\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n{% lineblog_image id=\"line-4186463-006\" alt=\"\" %}\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nWe've never demonstrated gameplay\n\non a livestream like this before,\nso I was nervous (lol)!\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nOf course we didn't know\nwhich Pokémon might appear... (lol)\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nIf we only got Ledyba, everyone would be disappointed...\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nBut\n\nWe luckily encountered a Pikipek!\n\n\n{% lineblog_image id=\"line-4186463-007\" alt=\"\" %}\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nAnd Yungoos!\n\n{% lineblog_image id=\"line-4186463-008\" alt=\"\" %}\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nIt didn't appear during the stream,\n\nbut there was a chance to encounter\nGrubbin in the tall grass, too!\n\n{% lineblog_image id=\"line-4186463-009\" alt=\"\" %}\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nAlso!\n\nAn all new type of battle:\n\nBattle Royal!\n\n\n{% lineblog_image id=\"line-4186463-010\" alt=\"\" %}\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n{% lineblog_image id=\"line-4186463-011\" alt=\"\" %}\n\nExciting 4-player battles!\nPlay over Wi-Fi, too!\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nGet excited for\nPokémon Sun &amp; Moon\nand your adventures\nin the Alola region!!\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nCiao!</div>",
